mathematicians and I wanted to solicit any from those of you in the audience.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:56.467
So I put a Google form in the description, essentially if you have

00:13:56.467 --> 00:14:00.446
done any kind of math research or honestly even just math as a student,

00:14:00.446 --> 00:14:03.540
where somehow incorporating an AI tool was of interest.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.301
Not necessarily because it was useful, but maybe because

00:14:06.301 --> 00:14:08.800
it was not useful in a particularly interesting way.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.498
If you think it's a story worth sharing, I'd love to hear it,

